#. Description of the theme
msgid ""
"Bosa is a fast, lightweight multipurpose WordPress theme built for Elementor "
"and WooCommerce. Design any type of site visually — business, portfolio, "
"blog, or store — no code required. Built with SEO, speed, and usability in "
"mind, Bosa supports custom headers, footers, and mega menus with Elementor, "
"and includes a full starter site you can import in one click. Works "
"seamlessly with Elementor and Gutenberg, and stays compatible with major "
"plugins like WooCommerce, Yoast, Contact Form 7, and Mailchimp. Bosa also "
"works with BEW, an Elementor addon offering widgets, templates, and AI-"
"powered content generation."
msgstr ""

